# Task 2: Splice in dict context — implemented.
# See macro_splice_dict.llt-eval for the real splice test.
# This test keeps a simple splice sanity check.
# Note: Using defmacro because variadic [let ...args] not yet supported in macro params.
[defmacro const-value [args]
  [quote 42]]

[result: [const-value]]
=== out
Dict({"result": Int(42)})
